# TypeScript Contract Proof

Changed contracts:

- `AppGameSessionEndReasonSchema`
- `AppGameSessionRollupDateSchema`
- `AppGameSessionSummarySchema`
- `AppGameSessionDailyRollupSchema`

Contract invariants:

- Closed sessions must pair `endedAt` with `endReason`.
- `foregroundDurationMs + backgroundDurationMs` must equal
  `runningDurationMs`.
- Nonzero foreground duration must cite `lastForegroundAt`.
- Nonzero background duration must cite `lastBackgroundAt`.
- Daily rollups must satisfy the same duration-total invariant and cite source
  session IDs.

Focused validation already run during implementation:

```text
cmd /c npm run test --workspace @ocentra-parent/activity-domain -- app-game.test.ts
PASS  packages/activity-domain/tests/app-game.test.ts
```

Final validation commands and refreshed results are recorded in
`10-validation-commands.log`.
